{"id":"n37178-1-7","stage":3,"title":"쫓겨나다 · 赶出","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37178-1-7-1","ko":"김 대리가 회사를 그만뒀다면서요.","zh":"听说金代理辞职了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）。","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"대리가","meaning":"代理","explanation":"대리：代理；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"대리","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48362","senseId":"2","lemma":"대리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대리가","audio":"/audio/796581cb979e1170e979.mp3"}},{"text":"회사를","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사를","audio":"/audio/62f80adf2dcac5e0aace.mp3"}},{"text":"그만뒀다면서요.","meaning":"停住，停","explanation":"그만두다：停住，停；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만뒀다면서요","audio":"/audio/2adca61b96c545871519.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4e96b696526850f7","term":"대리","zh":"代理","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3","entryId":"48362","definition":"公司中一般职员与课长之间的职位；或位居该职位的人。","pronunciation":["대ː리"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"55dca49e4d54e352","term":"그만두다","zh":"停住，停","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3","entryId":"62318","definition":"停住正在做的事，不再进行。","pronunciation":["그만두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/16a5e064794236e5f504.mp3","speakerIn